rticles/frances-fiscal-outlook-deteriorates-but-a-full-blown-crisis-remains-unlikely/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"405\",\"title\":\"France - Trade balance 2024 - countryeconomy.com\",\"description\":\"France - Trade balance ; 2024, €-102,657.7M · $-111,114.6M ; 2023, €-126,780.1M · $-137,403.6M ; 2022, €-193,143.7M · $-202,755.2M ; 2021, €-110,305.7M · $-129,267.0M ...\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://countryeconomy.com/trade/balance/france\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"406\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://santandertrade.com/en/portal/analyse-markets/france/foreign-trade-in-figures\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"407\",\"title\":\"France Exports By Country - Trading Economics\",\"description\":\"France's total Exports in 2024 were valued at US$645.96 Billion, according ... France's main export partners were: Germany, the United States and Italy.\",\"url\":\"https://tradingeconomics.com/france/exports-by-country\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"408\",\"title\":\"World Competitiveness Ranking 2025 - IMD Business School\",\"description\":\"The latest edition was released in June 2025. Go to the 2025 full results of 69 economies. - IMD Business School.\",\"url\":\"https://www.imd.org/centers/wcc/world-competitiveness-center/rankings/world-competitiveness-ranking/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"409\",\"title\":\"France Competitiveness Rank - Trading Economics\",\"description\":\"France is the 15 most competitive nation in the world out of 140 countries ranked in the 2019 edition of the Global Competitiveness Report.\",\"url\":\"https://tradingeconomics.com/france/competitiveness-rank\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"410\",\"title\":\"France - Share of trade with the EU: Share of exports to EU\",\"description\":\"Share of exports to EU was 54.00% in December of 2024, according to the EUROSTAT. Trading Economics provides the current actual value, an historical data chart ...\",\"url\":\"https://tradingeconomics.com/france/share-of-trade-with-the-e