\"Aug 15, 2025 · In 2023, 678,000 children were born in France, 48,000 fewer than in 2022. The decrease is due mainly to the decline in fertility (rather than a ...\",\"url\":\"https://muse.jhu.edu/article/967963\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"433\",\"title\":\"French fertility is the highest in Europe.Because of its immigrants?\",\"description\":\"Jul 8, 2019 · Immigrant mothers account for 19% of all births in France today. The total fertility rate of immigrant women is higher than that of native-born ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.ined.fr/en/news/press/french-fertility-is-the-highest-in-europe-because-of-its-immigrants/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"434\",\"title\":\"Fertility statistics - Statistics Explained - Eurostat\",\"description\":\"In 2023, the share of children born to foreign-born mothers stood at 23%. The foreign-born mothers shown in the Figure 7 concern mothers who were not born in ...\",\"url\":\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Fertility_statistics\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"435\",\"title\":\"Immigration Births in France: a Powerful Trend\",\"description\":\"Jun 20, 2025 · Births to immigrant women peak in the first year after arrival, with inactive women having higher rates. Over 30% of French births are to at ...\",\"url\":\"https://inirnet.org/article-written-for-inir/immigration_births_in_france_a_powerful_trend\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"436\",\"title\":\"France Demographics [2025 Updated] - Quantumrun Foresight\",\"description\":\"Sep 24, 2025 · The age structure of France population demographics reveals a gradually aging society. ... The median age in France is 42.3 years as of 2025 ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.quantumrun.com/consulting/france-demographics/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"437\",\"title\":\"France's demographic civil war - UnHerd\",\"description\":\"Apr 4, 2022 · ... projected to represent between 13 to 18% of the whole population around 2050. Given that France hosts at least several hundreds of thousands ...\",\"url\":\"https://unherd.com/2022/04/frances-demographic-civil-war/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"438\",\"title\":\"Population projections - Insee\",\"description\":\"The starting point of the population projections established by INSEE for France is the last final population numbers by sex and age.Missing:  median aging\",\"url\":\"https://www.insee.fr/en/metadonnees/source/serie/s1316\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"439\",\"title\":\"French fertility is the highest in Europe. Because of its immigrants?\",\"description\":\"With a total fertility rate of 1.9 children per woman in 2017, France is close to replacement level. Is this due to the presence of immigrants, as is often ...\",\"url\":\"https://shs.cairn.info/journal-population-and-societies-2019-7-page-1?lang=en\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"440\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://home-affairs.ec.europa.eu/news/france-new-and-inspiring-initiatives-immigration-statistics-and-reports-combating-discrimination-2025-10-24_en\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"441\",\"title\":\"France: International Migration Outlook 2024 | OECD\",\"description\":\"Nov 14, 2024 · Foreign-born population – 2023. 13.8% of the population. Main countries of birth: ; Size: 8.9 million, 52% women. Evolution since 2013: +18%.\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.oecd.org/en/publications/2024/11/international-migration-outlook-2024_c6f3e803/full-report/france_c739c214.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"442\",\"title\":\"In 2023, 2.4 million immigrants born in Europe lived in France - Insee\",\"description\":\"Aug 29, 2024 · In 2023, 32% of immigrants living in France were born in Europe. Nearly three quarters of them came from a European Union (EU) country.\",\"url\":\"https://www.insee.fr/en/statistiques/8245945\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"443\",\"title\":\"Immigrants by country of birth - France - Data - Ined - Ined\",\"description\":\"Immigrants by country of birth (p): Provisional data Metro