":\"626\",\"title\":\"[PDF] France After Maastricht - Roper Center for Public Opinion Research\",\"description\":\"To understand the shock introduced into French politics by the September 20 referendum on ratification of the. Maastricht Treaty, we need to recall a few.\",\"url\":\"https://ropercenter.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/2018-07/41028.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"627\",\"title\":\"France delivers its judgment, and Europe is plunged into crisis\",\"description\":\"May 29, 2005 · France's voters last night decisively rejected the new European constitution, plunging the country into political upheaval and the EU into the deepest crisis ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2005/may/30/eu.france\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"628\",\"title\":\"The French Referendum : the not so simple act of saying nay\",\"description\":\"On May 29, 2005, 54.7% of French voters rejected the European Constitutional Treaty, even though France was one of the major proponents of the European ...\",\"url\":\"https://sciencespo.hal.science/hal-03416023v1\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"629\",\"title\":\"Marine Le Pen and the EU: from Frexit to a Europe of Nations\",\"description\":\"Aug 6, 2025 · Criticism of EU institutions was sharp, with the European Commission condemned as illegitimate and overreaching. Across these domains, Le Pen's ...\",\"url\":\"https://safia.gr/marine-le-pen-and-the-eu-from-frexit-to-a-europe-of-nations/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"630\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.lyddonconsulting.com/frances-woes-are-attributable-to-its-lack-of-economic-and-monetary-sovereignty/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"631\",\"title\":\"French farmers protest EU agricultural pact with South American ...\",\"description\":\"Nov 18, 2024 · Leading the charge of the new protests in France are unions, who oppose provisions such as duty-free imports of beef, poultry and sugar, which ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/french-f